OL,3,GNEWSAGirl gets tumour diagnosis 12
OL,4,Ahours after eye test
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum said she "fell apart" after
OL,7,Ffinding out her four-year-old daughter
OL,8,Fhad a brain tumour, just 12 hours after
OL,9,Fan eye test.
OL,11,FKatie, 41, said her daughter Phoebe,
OL,12,Fnow five, started to be sick and was
OL,13,Fgetting severe headaches in February,
OL,14,Fbut was told "it was just migraines" by
OL,15,Fa GP.
OL,17,FFollowing an eye test in May, Katie was
OL,18,Fcalled by the optician who told her to
OL,19,Ftake her daughter straight to A&E at
OL,20,FAddenbrooke's Hospital in Cambridge.
OL,21,FJust hours later, she was diagnosed
OL,22,Fwith a brain tumour.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
